<title>USA: Royce Funds says it not for sale.</title>
<headline>Royce Funds says it not for sale.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Royce Funds said it was not for sale.</p>
<p>&quot;We are not currently for sale, nor have we been in discussions&quot; about a sale, said Joanne Newgard, a spokeswoman for the firm.</p>
<p>Fund Action, an industry newsletter, reported in its September 16 edition that the New York-based Royce &quot;is testing the waters on being acquired.&quot;</p>
<p>Newgard said the firm has no plans to seek a buyer, and Royce is not currently considering a strategic alliance with another fund company.</p>
</text>
